senses.gloss:
मधुक (at the end of a comp.) = मधु;
(अस्, आ, अम्), sweet; sweet-speaking, mellifluous,
melodious; of the colour of honey; (अस्), m. a par-
ticular tree, = मधूक (Bassia Latifolia); = अशोक;
= वल्लि; a bard, panegyrist (? वन्दि-भेद for
वल्लि-भेद); the liquorice-root; a species of bird;
N. of a man; (आ), f. a particular plant (= वल्लि-
भेद); Menispermum Glabrum, Glycyrrhiza Gla-
bra; a black kind of panic-grass; (अम्), n. liquorice;
tin.

माध्यमक, अस्, इका, अम्, = माध्यमिक;
(इका), f. epithet of the middle section of the Kā-
ṭhaka.
